      "updated": 1786005576476,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1- Go to clerk.com\n2- create a new applicaiton\n3- add setup for the application and choose the sign & options like (email, github, google & etc..)\n4- installation\n    - @clerk/nextjs & @clerk/themes \n    - .env variables (NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY & CLERK_SECRET_KEY)\n    - add proxy.ts to secure the app routes\n    - Wrap the entire app with <ThemeProvider/> to provide access to Clerk helpers globall\n    - (optional) adding dark theme <ClerkProvider appearance={{theme: dark}}>\n    - note: The browser's system theme (dark/light) overrides the default Clerk theme.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1- Go to clerk.com\n2- create a new applicaiton\n3- add setup for the application and choose the sign & options like (email, github, google & etc..)\n4- installation\n    - @clerk/nextjs & @clerk/themes \n    - .env variables (NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY & CLERK_SECRET_KEY)\n    - add proxy.ts to secure the app routes\n    - Wrap the entire app with <ThemeProvider/> to provide access to Clerk helpers globall\n    - (optional) adding dark theme <ClerkProvider appearance={{theme: dark}}>\n    - note: The browser's system theme (dark/light) overrides the default Clerk theme.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
